graph LR
    AGC["ai-gateway-controller"]

    %% Go / build dependencies
    AGC -->|manager, cache, leader election| CR["controller-runtime v0.25.2"]
    AGC -->|API types, pod logs| ClientGo["client-go / api v0.37.0"]
    AGC -->|krusty rendering| Kustomize["kustomize api/kyaml v0.21.1"]
    AGC -->|RFC 8785 overlay envelopes| JCS["gowebpki/jcs v1.0.1"]

    %% External platform dependencies
    AGC -->|EnvoyFilter, DR, ServiceEntry| Istio["Istio Gateway<br/>networking.istio.io"]
    AGC -->|HTTPRoute, ReferenceGrant| GWAPI["Gateway API"]
    AGC -->|AuthPolicy| Kuadrant["Kuadrant / RHCL Authorino"]
    AGC -.->|ServiceMonitor, optional| PromOp["prometheus-operator"]
    AGC -->|deploys image| Praxis["praxis-extproc image<br/>digest-pinned"]
    AGC -.->|deploys image, OIDC only| KAP["kube-auth-proxy image"]
    AGC -->|serving certs| ServiceCA["OpenShift service-ca"]
    AGC -->|resolve OIDC host| Routes["OpenShift Routes"]

    %% Internal platform dependencies
    AGC -->|watch/patch tenant CRs,<br/>status handshake| MaaS["maas-controller<br/>models-as-a-service"]
    AGC -->|disables ExtProc on route| MaaSAPI["maas-api"]
    AGC -->|NemoGuardrails watch + callouts| TrustyAI["TrustyAI NeMo Guardrails"]
    AGC -->|DSCInitialization watch| RHODS["rhods-operator"]
    AGC -->|portal backend via ReferenceGrant| Dashboard["odh-dashboard maas-portal"]
    MaaS -.->|installs inference CRDs| AGC

    %% Integration points
    Operator["ai-gateway-operator"] -->|deploys config/self| AGC
    Admin["ExternalModel / ExternalProvider<br/>/ AIGuardrail authors"] -->|CRs| AGC

    %% External services
    AGC -->|watch / SSA / pods/log| K8sAPI["Kubernetes API"]
    Praxis -.->|runtime egress via Gateway| Providers["External LLM Providers"]

